---
title: "supplyTokens (LegionFixedPriceSale)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_check_caller: project admin supplies tokens
    q_check_caller --> q_check_results: caller is projectAdmin
    q_check_caller --> q_revert_auth: unauthorized
    q_check_results --> q_check_not_supplied: sale results published
    q_check_results --> q_revert_results: results not published
    q_check_not_supplied --> q_calc_total: tokens not already supplied
    q_check_not_supplied --> q_revert_supplied: already supplied
    q_calc_total --> q_transfer: totalRequired = totalTokensAllocated + legionTokenFee + referrerTokenFee
    q_transfer --> q_mark: transferFrom(projectAdmin, address(this), totalRequired)
    q_transfer --> q_revert_transfer: transfer failed
    q_mark --> [*]: tokensSupplied = true, emit TokensSupplied(totalRequired)
    q_revert_auth --> [*]: revert Unauthorized
    q_revert_results --> [*]: revert ResultsNotPublished
    q_revert_supplied --> [*]: revert AlreadySupplied
    q_revert_transfer --> [*]: revert TransferFailed

    note right of q_calc_total
        INV-001: totalRequired includes all allocations plus platform and referrer fees
        INV-002: Token supply only possible after results published (allocation amounts known)
    end note
